Z||000009||erikred||10-16-2001||04:48 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by HummelHund:<BR><B>A side note, I saw a multi-port injection intake manifold w/ injectors and ECM for a Jeep 2.5L I-4 on ebay. I have heard this is the same engine as is in our Fieros. Is it, and if so, could Multi-port Injection be retrofitted to a TBI Duke?<BR>TIA<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The port injected Jeep engines are an AMC design and completly different from the Pontiac 2.5 which did come in early eighties Jeeps for a few years only to be replaced by the AMC engine.<P>||||reg||1
